      "source": [
        "# Boolean operations\n",
        "\n",
        "`and` and `or` short-circuit and return an operand, not necessarily a Boolean. `not` returns a Boolean.\n",
        "\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "id": "f3a3a344e6cda685",
      "metadata": {
      },
      "source": [
        "[] or [1]  # [1]\n",
        "not 0  # True\n"
      ],
      "execution_count": null,
